50ae			; | | gap - Gap period counter; default is 250 
50ae			; | | hpulse - Count of pulses for 1; default is 6 
50ae			; | | lpulse - Count of pulses for 0; default is 2 
50ae			; | | high - High bit period counter; default is 150 
